The compiled `wg` binary contains other Rust crates. The release archive's
`licenses/DEPENDENCY_LICENSES.txt` and `licenses/deps/` list the license files
copied from the Cargo registry source that resolved `Cargo.lock`. If a package
license file is not available in that cache, the index marks it `unavailable`
instead of inventing a license.
